ax gap 600 from 1006 to 1860 in this window.\"\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 51532, "total_output_tokens": 10406, "total_tokens": 61938, "total_latency_ms": 145768, "llm_calls": 8, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}